{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the slope-skidding, rocket-dodging, ice-shooting psycho you've always dreamed of in this hardcore speed-running game. Your goal? Traverse open, blocky terrain however you see fit to hit checkpoints and cross the finish line before your opponents. Compete online, or host private games with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/extras/anim2.gif?t=1768175419\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build terrain blocks, blow up bridges, slide across vast mountain ranges, rocket jump over buildings, or shove foes off cliffs. Winning earns you rank, pitting you against players of similar skill. Each map brings unique gameplay with lootable weapons, varied terrain, and creative obstacles. Choose from six characters, each with distinct abilities to suit your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/extras/anim0.gif?t=1768175419\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use rocket jumps, homing ice missiles, giant mushrooms, and jetpacks to gain an edge over your foes. Build ramps, create barriers, or destroy paths to propel yourself or hinder others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/extras/anim1.gif?t=1768175419\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robust ranking system ensures competitive play, matching you with similarly skilled players. With matches lasting 1 to 10 minutes, there's always time for another race. Whether you're cooperating with friends or wreaking havoc on them, Landslip delivers endless fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/extras/splitter.png?t=1768175419\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching with 5 infinite maps, and more to come soon, Landslip offers near-endless replayability. As you master characters, weapons, jetpacks and terrain, the game\u2019s depth and variety will keep you hooked. Join the race, dominate the leaderboard, and redefine speed-running!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462870?t=1768175419","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/046214e31c3ac7467e3b04f5e06294b13bc8f0bf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768175419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/3e0bd2d3014af306736080155cf82d33e594282e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768175419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/3e0bd2d3014af306736080155cf82d33e594282e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768175419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the slope-skidding, rocket-dodging, ice-shooting psycho you've always dreamed of in this hardcore speed-running game. Your goal? Traverse open, blocky terrain however you see fit to hit checkpoints and cross the finish line before your opponents. Compete online, or host private games with friends and family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/extras/anim2.gif?t=1768175419\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build terrain blocks, blow up bridges, slide across vast mountain ranges, rocket jump over buildings, or shove foes off cliffs. Winning earns you rank, pitting you against players of similar skill. Each map brings unique gameplay with lootable weapons, varied terrain, and creative obstacles. Choose from six characters, each with distinct abilities to suit your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/extras/anim0.gif?t=1768175419\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use rocket jumps, homing ice missiles, giant mushrooms, and jetpacks to gain an edge over your foes. Build ramps, create barriers, or destroy paths to propel yourself or hinder others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/extras/anim1.gif?t=1768175419\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A robust ranking system ensures competitive play, matching you with similarly skilled players. With matches lasting 1 to 10 minutes, there's always time for another race. Whether you're cooperating with friends or wreaking havoc on them, Landslip delivers endless fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462870/extras/splitter.png?t=1768175419\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launching with 5 infinite maps, and more to come soon, Landslip offers near-endless replayability. As you master characters, weapons, jetpacks and terrain, the game\u2019s depth and variety will keep you hooked. Join the race, dominate the leaderboard, and redefine speed-running!</p>","developers":["Pixel Doctrine"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st